/*
 * GPIO 12 -- the flash pin from the schematic -- used to carry a `gpio-leds`
 * node here, exported as `led::flash_torch`.  It toggles the pin correctly
 * and lights nothing: the LEDs are driven by the "Hill" three-channel flash
 * IC on CCI master 0, and nothing emits until that part is configured over
 * I2C.  The pin now belongs to the flash driver
 * (`qcom,led-flash@60` in msm8992-talkman-camera.dtsi), which is the only
 * thing that knows what to do with it, and the working flashlight is
 * /sys/class/leds/flash-torch.
 *
 * Left as an empty include so the chi.dtsi include list does not change.
 */
